  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The alterations to the roof under this certificate of lawful development application do not apply in this case as the building operations involved in the construction of the existing roof are unlawful under Section 3, 5(a) of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended). Rights under the Order cannot be claimed retrospectively and there is no lawful fall back to which the applicant could revert.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal is NOT therefore a lawful development.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
